# BUGS

Transfers are polled, not interrupt-driven, and use neither the controller's FIFOs nor DMA.
Ten-bit addresses, high-speed mode, SMBus's block reads and the controller as a target aren't supported.
A bus a target holds low isn't recovered by clocking it free.
